OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof occasionally heavy rain, perhaps
OL,8,Fthundery at times. Rain overnight
OL,9,Fremains more persistent over the
OL,10,FWestern Isles, dry interludes and
OL,11,Fshowers elsewhere.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FIt will remain cloudy with
OL,14,Ffurther showers or longer spells of
OL,15,Frain, often heavy. Fresh north to
OL,16,Fnortheasterly winds around the Western
OL,17,FIsles and the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
