OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Ffew showers on Thursday morning but
OL,7,Fbecoming dry and bright in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Mostly cloudy on Friday and
OL,9,FSaturday with showers or longer spells
OL,10,Fof rain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
